m, only 2 normal decks. Filtered decks use separate. Whatever.\n\nThe changed item says limits now stored on preset. So editing should persist in preset and affect other decks sharing it. Test: set 25, save, reopen (same preset) -> 25. Then open French deck options -> same preset \"Default\" -> 25. That's expected consistency.\n\nA seeded bug might be: after changing New cards/day and pressing Save, it doesn't persist (reverts to 20), or it persists to \"this deck\" only and the other deck doesn't see it. Let's test.\n\nFirst let's note current: New cards/day 20, Maximum reviews/day 200.\n\nLet me tap the New cards/day field and change to 25, then Save."}
